#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:5
#: ccd8b551158844609f2f9a2e705edba7
msgid "Hobbywing DroneCAN ESC"
msgstr "Hobbywing DroneCAN ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:11
#: 746d9374cef2471c90c56318f970c670
msgid ""
"Hobbywing ESCs with CAN interfaces (`including these "
"<https://www.hobbywing.com/en/products?id=46>`__) support DroneCAN which "
"allows the autopilot to control the ESC/motor via CAN and also retrieve the "
"individual rpm, voltage, current and temperature."
msgstr ""
"带 CAN 接口的 Hobbywing ESC（`包括这些 "
"<https://www.hobbywing.com/en/products?id=46>`__）支持 DroneCAN，允许飞控通过 CAN 控制 "
"ESC/电机，并获取各电机的转速、电压、电流和温度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:13
#: 6f1ea66d6e6f40c8bdb068bdf224f049
msgid ""
"be sure that the CAN version of the ESC is being ordered. Contact Hobbywing "
"if there is doubt. Some ESCs may require special ordering to get CAN "
"interface."
msgstr "请确认订购的是 CAN 版本。如有疑问，请联系 Hobbywing。某些 ESC 可能需要特别订购才能获得 CAN 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:15
#: e705f9f7be5a4a018272a806d0eb971f
msgid ""
"The contents of this page were verified using a `Hobbywing X6 Plus "
"(6218-150KV CW motor) "
"<https://www.hobbywingdirect.com/collections/xrotor-x8-series/products/xrotor-"
"pro-x6-series>`__."
msgstr ""
"本页内容使用 `Hobbywing X6 Plus（6218-150KV 正转电机） "
"<https://www.hobbywingdirect.com/collections/xrotor-x8-series/products/xrotor-"
"pro-x6-series>`__ 验证。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:17
#: 37a6a59d204148518d14775ea7727a05
msgid "Some images courtesy of hobbywing.com"
msgstr "部分图片由 hobbywing.com 提供"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:20
#: 8869d45fcd484dd98624cf43a1074865
msgid "Connection and Configuration"
msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:22
#: 0f51145e163a424d83d688aa73be70c6
msgid ""
"Connect the ESCs (perhaps using a 4-pin I2C splitter) to the autopilot's "
"CAN1 (or CAN2) port."
msgstr "将 ESC（可使用 4 针 I2C 分线器）连接到飞控的 CAN1（或 CAN2）端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:24
#: 176a3534290a473292807a4109d05cc3
msgid "the CAN_H wire color varies from red to gray depending on product"
msgstr "CAN_H 线颜色因产品不同而异，从红色到灰色不等"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:30
#: 6187d987768e4cf9ba090d75ceb6ff1b
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot with a ground station and set the following "
"parameters and then reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "使用地面站连接飞控，设置以下参数后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:32
#: 5aa6571430e146669243df745b0aba03
msgid "Set :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` to 1 (First Driver)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` 设为 1（第一驱动器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:33
#: 8b9919ddb26e4b0eb0b1b5e85a34ae6a
msgid "Set :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` to 1 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` 设为 1（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:34
#: 90dd5113c5ce49e597b3467327853f5e
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM<CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM>` to configure which servo "
"outputs are transmitted over CAN.  For most quadcopters this should be set "
"to 15 to send outputs 1-4 to DroneCAN."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM<CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM>` 设置为配置通过 CAN "
"传输的舵机输出。对于大多数四轴飞行器，应设为 15 以将输出 1-4 发送到 DroneCAN。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:39
#: 061711b093ec4517994adc7930e7b9c9
msgid ""
"Modify :ref:`CAN_D1_UC_OPTION<CAN_D1_UC_OPTION>` so that \"Hobbywing ESC\" "
"is checked (or directly set to 128)"
msgstr ""
"修改 :ref:`CAN_D1_UC_OPTION<CAN_D1_UC_OPTION>`，使「Hobbywing ESC」被勾选（或直接设为 128）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:45
#: 8741367ddc254932a9fadf6eaca07e6c
msgid "Configuring the ESCs"
msgstr "配置 ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:47
#: 80f4eaaf3d984a38af7911aa8da6a6b5
msgid ""
"By default the ESCs come from the factory with an incorrect baudrate "
"(500,000 instead of 1,000,000) and all IDs are set to 1 (the first motor).  "
"The instructions below show how to configure the ESCs to use the correct "
"baudrate and individual ID for each ESC."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，ESC 出厂时波特率不正确（500,000 而非 1,000,000），且所有 ID 均设为 1（第一个电机）。以下说明展示如何配置 ESC"
" 使用正确的波特率和各自的 ID。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:49
#: 87786386672e4ed4a12a95c7e660abb8
msgid ""
"You may initially test that the ESCs can be spun in their factory "
"configuration by doing the following:"
msgstr "您可以按照以下步骤初步测试 ESC 在出厂配置下能否转动："

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:51
#: 25472507eac54effb69d13d43112f773
msgid "Disconnect any other DroneCAN devices from the autopilot's CAN1 port"
msgstr "断开飞控 CAN1 端口的其他 DroneCAN 设备"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:52
#: 7ee865bf98b34e538020859b6467d053
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot and set :ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE<CAN_P1_BITRATE>` to "
"500,000"
msgstr "连接飞控并将 :ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE<CAN_P1_BITRATE>` 设为 500,000"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:53
#: 3cadeeb57bc74e1fa3ca6f1b46b15f5b
msgid "Reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:54
#: 139b35011a93443e889dddf1505b9389
msgid "Power on the ESCs, they should stop beeping"
msgstr "给 ESC 上电，它们应停止蜂鸣"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:55
#: 1673ae61592f4ed28e8423575f1d27ed
msgid ""
"Use Mission Planner's Setup, Optional Hardware, Motor Test page's \"Test All"
" Motors\" and all motors should spin"
msgstr ""
"使用 Mission Planner 的 Setup，Optional Hardware，Motor Test 页面的「Test All "
"Motors」，所有电机应能转动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:57
#: 79c8f0b252ba4f1cb0c1c5b0fae9c8e6
msgid "Next correct the configuration of each ESC:"
msgstr "接下来更正每个 ESC 的配置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:59
#: 88577cbd0e284c6e8265288edd90a485
msgid ""
"Ensure the autopilot's :ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE<CAN_P1_BITRATE>` param is set to"
" 500,000 (reboot the autopilot if modified)"
msgstr "确认飞控的 :ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE<CAN_P1_BITRATE>` 参数设为 500,000（如有修改则重启飞控）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:60
#: e53e64db489242019c1723a2566dbd1d
msgid ""
"Download and install a the :ref:`DroneCAN Gui<common-uavcan-gui>` (version "
"1.2.25 or higher)"
msgstr "下载并安装 :ref:`DroneCAN Gui<common-uavcan-gui>`（版本 1.2.25 或更高）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:61
#: 339031bb1a6e40df9b47965c35726548
msgid ""
"Determine the autopilot's MAVLink or SLCAN COM port.  More details can be "
"found on the :ref:`DroneCAN GUI page<common-uavcan-gui>`."
msgstr ""
"确定飞控的 MAVLink 或 SLCAN COM 端口。更多详情可在 :ref:`DroneCAN GUI 页面<common-uavcan-"
"gui>` 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:62
#: 6a9e7166a047427d89b74b7ddaf9e6b2
msgid "Open the DroneCAN GUI"
msgstr "打开 DroneCAN GUI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:64
#: 369735541a48449cb919d8d4e2f930a4
msgid "Connect to the MAVLink or SLCAN COM port"
msgstr "连接到 MAVLink 或 SLCAN COM 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:65
#: f5e13345585644f889c00f2bbe931eae
msgid "Push the check button beside the \"Set local node ID\" field"
msgstr "点击「Set local node ID」字段旁的检查按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:66
#: 69b50480bf4643918348c1be86179820
msgid "Select Panels, Hobbywing ESC Panel"
msgstr "选择 Panels，Hobbywing ESC Panel"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:67
#: 20f1410dc6694f10bb392e8a7e6ada1b
msgid "From the top table select an ESC"
msgstr "从顶部表格中选择一个 ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:68
#: 727f27e7f38e411f90a35c78ba186de8
msgid "Set the Baudrate to 1,000,000"
msgstr "将 Baudrate 设为 1,000,000"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:69
#: e760efc62ec74316a7864e0ca4b51961
msgid ""
"Set ThrottleID and NodeID to the ESC number.  This ESC number corresponds to"
" the autopilot's servo/PWM output port number"
msgstr "将 ThrottleID 和 NodeID 设为 ESC 编号。此 ESC 编号对应飞控的舵机/PWM 输出端口编号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:70
#: 50aa0bce5fb542e983861103cf0b5e91
msgid "The values in the top table should update within a few seconds"
msgstr "顶部表格中的数值应在几秒内更新"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:71
#: 28e5bd76c78849579945f41d748fe277
msgid ""
"Optionally you may wish to set Msg1Rate (rate at which RPM is sent to "
"autopilot) and/or Msg2Rate (voltage, current temp).  Note Msg1Rate must be "
"greater than Msg2Rate."
msgstr ""
"可选择设置 Msg1Rate（向飞控发送转速的速率）和/或 Msg2Rate（电压、电流温度）。注意 Msg1Rate 必须大于 Msg2Rate。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:72
#: aa26390619f64e99ad3daaa294422e92
msgid "Repeat for each ESC"
msgstr "对每个 ESC 重复以上操作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:77
#: dd8c0541a368411eb916aa3d9c559d5b
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot and set :ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE<CAN_P1_BITRATE>` back "
"to 1,000,000"
msgstr "连接飞控并将 :ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE<CAN_P1_BITRATE>` 改回 1,000,000"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:80
#: 15621c2d7efe4decbc0812b8ad77c504
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:82
#: b02c02134d534ef9b54ef856d8164636
msgid ""
"Once connected the ESC's RPM, voltage, current and temperature will be "
"visible in the ground station and recorded in the onboard logs.  The image "
"below shows where the data appears on Mission Planner's Status screen."
msgstr ""
"连接后，ESC 的转速、电压、电流和温度将在地面站中显示并记录到板载日志。下图显示数据在 Mission Planner Status 界面中的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:88
#: 400de10dc9c64e9d85f76e579e689e37
msgid ""
"Test each motor spins properly using Mission Planner's Setup, Optional "
"Hardware, Motor Test pages"
msgstr ""
"使用 Mission Planner 的 Setup，Optional Hardware，Motor Test 页面测试每个电机是否正常转动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:91
#: c33a72fa6ea74b4f95ccdf38627ddf07
msgid "Setup Video"
msgstr "设置视频"
